I found a published-numbering error: Pascadi’s large-sieve statement is Lemma 3.4, not Lemma 3.3; the journal version numbers the intervening remark. Lemma 3.2 still matches the claimed input. The large-sieve calculation and the final design’s fixed power margins check out. I have found no fatal analytic error.

